     "Hi,<div>I am a new learner of Lavaan. I would very much appreciate if anyone can offer any tips on my questions.</div><div><br></div><div>I used the example in Lavaan totorial as my example.</div><div><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">Suppose three latent variables: visual, textual and speed:<br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/R7gO9f6FIo8rOlGuwky48aXKl8QwSpgTu45XvMhBdBADlgBoSevdy73y5z2q9xrP5iFWUPoGbiYNrdByZgFTmT4f00bGRjPOgK4PNMEeJd1mg7FyJwec71XscnkiOyBoIx27oM2K0GC_x_i1Nw0HpWg71j8NTJMeKC2EpNrnblr9JOgmTrTI9v-MwFP4zPSFA2vki9CQbbmRB8pvveI3knqyITS0GBgBSQv7l_2ChwMFVo1YPwd4Azv8hxsBUkNbRVBdCz65vNOEtMhoYoHW8FUWy4zgrBuZUambS0KvwDYLJM3E6cWe0u93fClpH9f7ZDrawAEbVDQvK5F57hm0Sx-xUx8xLvvU_JNfzhAV-W6Z4m8lmZVIbFO_odC41EPmLeupxVPN5jIuDq4VbYZ2r5Q5wRKLdqXF5kO6jCyGlyJIg0lGvTMxKW3hCaL9ev7GvliCvS1mN6TzliaKWxC9bzpJQceNltAVR9G4Hcz-Q8A=s0-d-e1-ft#https://mail.cstat.msu.edu/owa/service.svc/s/GetFileAttachment?id=AAMkADQzODYyZDQ1LTU1MDgtNDkzOC04NGVkLTFjYmZiYWU0OWY0OQBGAAAAAABNQYZE0y02S7%2BoSw4ThtmmBwB9Q5PIC%2Bw3Q77ccoegx9IdAAAAAAEJAAB9Q5PIC%2Bw3Q77ccoegx9IdAAGKq6PTAAABEgAQAJqSSi%2BGZY1Er0SZSj3KX%2BI%3D&amp;X-OWA-CANARY=-EIqQVXMrUWCn4nVB2c5kXJmWwrrw9MINUGkOzrqi9tMvPBQBeHnMPvf_4TOQDSVUrTfyJeRSPA.\" name=\"m_-873095491377244999_null\" title=\"pastedImage.png\" style=\"display:inline\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">I got: CFI=0.931, TLI=0.896; RMSEA=.092, CI for RMSEA (0.071, 0.114); SRMR=0.065.<br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">The fit is not super good. We obtained the modification indices and found two of them are larger than 10. Suppose I have three latent variables: visual, textual and speed:<br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/R7gO9f6FIo8rOlGuwky48aXKl8QwSpgTu45XvMhBdBADlgBoSevdy73y5z2q9xrP5iFWUPoGbiYNrdByZgFTmT4f00bGRjPOgK4PNMEeJd1mg7FyJwec71XscnkiOyBoIx27oM2K0GC_x_i1Nw0HpWg71j8NTJMeKC2EpNrnblr9JOgmTrTI9v-MwFP4zPSFA2vki9CQbbmRB8pvveI3knqyITS0GBgBSQv7l_2ChwMFVo1YPwd4Azv8hxsBUkNbRVBdCz65vNOEtMhoYoHW8FUWy4zgrBuZUambS0KvwDYLJM3E6cWe0u93fClpH9f7ZDrawAEbVDQvK5F57hm0Sx-xUx8xLvvU_JNfzhAV-W6Z4m8lmZVIbFO_odC41EPmLeupxVPN5jIuDq4VbYZ2r5Q5wRKLdqXF5kO6jCyGlyJIg0lGvTMxKW3hCaL9ev7GvliCvS1mN6TzliaKWxC9bzpJQceNltAVR9G4Hcz-Q8A=s0-d-e1-ft#https://mail.cstat.msu.edu/owa/service.svc/s/GetFileAttachment?id=AAMkADQzODYyZDQ1LTU1MDgtNDkzOC04NGVkLTFjYmZiYWU0OWY0OQBGAAAAAABNQYZE0y02S7%2BoSw4ThtmmBwB9Q5PIC%2Bw3Q77ccoegx9IdAAAAAAEJAAB9Q5PIC%2Bw3Q77ccoegx9IdAAGKq6PTAAABEgAQAJqSSi%2BGZY1Er0SZSj3KX%2BI%3D&amp;X-OWA-CANARY=-EIqQVXMrUWCn4nVB2c5kXJmWwrrw9MINUGkOzrqi9tMvPBQBeHnMPvf_4TOQDSVUrTfyJeRSPA.\" name=\"m_-873095491377244999_null\" title=\"pastedImage.png\" style=\"display:inline\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">I got: CFI=0.931, TLI=0.896; RMSEA=.092, CI for RMSEA (0.071, 0.114); SRMR=0.065.<br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">The fit is not super good. We obtained the modification indices and found two of them are larger than 10. <br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></p><p style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Calibri,Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><img src=\"https://ci4.googleusercontent.com/proxy/gTWutnJ7C1C68ngQC2TFIlLX1xcJsTQyC0WcoHrzxGemmb5uy5xa69STvW9Hu-1aUmq9MRlEKrieceFV0JFZuWnTYh_5f6BobdpJlNTHQJLOSFoITv4hOP-Zt48r4wngXZlFdhDnb-aC0mQuGRfWISmV3O3_sZIOR